      "function": "quests",
      "text": {
        "jp": "帝都への長旅でおつかれでしょう。\n宿屋では安らぎの寝床と、美味しい料理を用意して、\nいつでもお客様をお待ちしています。\n粗品を差し上げますので、是非一度お越しください！",
        "official_en": "Feet tired? Head weary? Perfect! Don't collapse from\nexhaustion—visit our inn where we specialize in\nwarm beds and delicious meals! We're giving all\nfirst-time visitors a free gift, so please come on by!",
        "real_en": null
      },
